                    {
                        "id": "5",
                        "text": "Paragraph 1"
                    },
                    {
                        "id": "6",
                        "text": "A general statement about the broad topic to establish that the research is important"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "notes": {
                "para": []
            },
            "content": {
                "para": [
                    [
                        {
                            "id": "8",
                            "text": " The Atlantic cod, ‘Gadus morhua’, is both ecologically and economically important, and it has sustained commercial fisheries on both the east and west sides of the North Atlantic. "
                        },
                        {
                            "id": "7",
                            "text": " However, overexploitation has led to declines and stock collapses "
                        },
                        {
                            "id": "9",
                            "text": " (Myers et al., 1996) "
                        },
                        {
                            "id": "7",
                            "text": " , and in many regions, cod are regarded as threatened "
                        },
                        {
                            "id": "10",
                            "text": " (Jonzen et al., 2002; Svedang and Bardon, 2003; Trzcinski et al., 2006; Arnason et al., 2009) "
                        },
                        {
                            "id": "7",
                            "text": " . Declines in abundance, along with an established consumer market, have provided a catalyst stimulating widespread interest in the production of this species by aquaculture. "
                        }
                    ]
                ],
                "placeHolder": "Type Paragraph 1 here.",
                "id": "7"
            }
        },
