                        {
                            "id": "45",
                            "text": " Knowledge of "
                        },
                        {
                            "id": "44",
                            "text": " the genetic interactions between wild and farmed marine fish "
                        },
                        {
                            "id": "65",
                            "text": " is sparse "
                        },
                        {
                            "id": "44",
                            "text": " , but "
                        },
                        {
                            "id": "46",
                            "text": " several attempts at "
                        },
                        {
                            "id": "44",
                            "text": " quantifying interactions between farmed and wild Atlantic salmon "
                        },
                        {
                            "id": "47",
                            "text": " have been published (Crozier, 1993, 2000; Clifford et al., 1998a, b; Skaala et al., 2006) "
                        },
                        {
                            "id": "44",
                            "text": " . These studies range from the quantification of gene flow from single escapement events affecting specific wild populations, to more ambitious investigations quantifying genetic changes in historical and contemporary samples of wild populations that have been subject to differing numbers of farmed escapees over time. "
                        },
                        {
                            "id": "48",
                            "text": " Both approaches have demonstrated "
                        },
                        {
                            "id": "44",
                            "text": " genetic changes in wild populations, "
                        },
                        {
                            "id": "49",
                            "text": " although "
                        },
                        {
                            "id": "44",
                            "text": " the full extent of introgression and the long-term implications for conservation "
                        },
                        {
                            "id": "50",
                            "text": " remain open to debate "
                        },
                        {
                            "id": "44",
                            "text": "."
                        }
